  "prefLabel": "Ins 2705.07 Outreach to Prescribing Providers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2705.07 Outreach to Prescribing Providers. Health insurers, pharmacy benefits managers, and utilization review entities shall educate contracted and other prescribing providers about the uniform prior authorization forms, including in partnership with membership organizations that represent those prescribing providers.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins2700.html"
